<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ config.brand.name }} AEO/GEO Snapshot | Free Preview</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/static/favicon.png">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/static/favicon.png">
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #0f172a;
    --ink-2: #1e293b;
    --muted: #64748b;
    --soft-muted: #94a3b8;
    --line: rgba(15,23,42,.10);
    --bg: #f6f8fc;
    --panel: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
    --panel-solid: #ffffff;
    --blue: #2563eb;
    --purple: #7c3aed;
    --cyan: #06b6d4;
    --warning: #d97706;
    --danger: #dc2626;
    --success: #16a34a;
    --radius: 28px;
    --radius-sm: 16px;
    --shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(15,23,42,.10);
    --shadow-soft: 0 14px 35px rgba(15,23,42,.08);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.62;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 8% 0%, rgba(37,99,235,.16), transparent 32rem),
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 8%, rgba(124,58,237,.12), transparent 30rem),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fbff 0%, #f8fafc 38%, #eef4ff 100%);
  }
  a { color: inherit; }
  code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace; font-size: .9em; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(37,99,235,.08); color: #1d4ed8; border: 1px solid rgba(37,99,235,.10); }

  .shell { width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 0 58px; }
  .topbar { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:18px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .brand { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; text-decoration:none; }
  .brand img.wordmark { display:block; height:30px; width:auto; }
  .top-actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:flex-end; gap:10px; }
  .chip { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; min-height:30px; padding:7px 11px; border-radius:999px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.78); border:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; font-weight:850; letter-spacing:.04em; text-transform:uppercase; backdrop-filter:blur(12px); }
  .chip.blue { color:#1d4ed8; background:rgba(239,246,255,.92); border-color:rgba(37,99,235,.18); }
  .chip.warning { color:#92400e; background:rgba(255,251,235,.94); border-color:rgba(217,119,6,.20); }
  .chip.dark { color:#334155; background:rgba(241,245,249,.92); }

  .hero { position:relative; overflow:hidden; border-radius:34px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,48px); color:white; background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15,23,42,.97), rgba(30,41,59,.96) 48%, rgba(30,64,175,.94) 100%); box-shadow:var(--shadow); }
  .hero::before { content:""; position:absolute; inset:-2px; background: radial-gradient(circle at 78% 20%, rgba(6,182,212,.30), transparent 25rem), radial-gradient(circle at 4% 90%, rgba(124,58,237,.33), transparent 23rem); pointer-events:none; }
  .hero-grid { position:relative; z-index:1; display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.16fr) minmax(320px,.84fr); gap:34px; align-items:stretch; }
  .eyebrow { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; width:max-content; padding:8px 12px; border-radius:999px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.10); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15); color:#bfdbfe; font-size:11px; font-weight:950; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  h1 { margin:20px 0 14px; max-width:840px; color:white; font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,72px); line-height:.94; letter-spacing:-.07em; font-weight:950; }
  .hero-lede { margin:0; max-width:760px; color:rgba(226,232,240,.82); font-size:18px; line-height:1.58; }
  .hero-lede + .hero-lede { margin-top: 13px; }
  .hero-lede strong { color:white; }
  .hero-meta { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-top:26px; }
  .hero .chip.blue { background:rgba(255,255,255,.96); color:#1d4ed8; border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.22); box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,.12); }
  .hero .chip.blue code { background:rgba(37,99,235,.12); color:#0f172a; border-color:rgba(37,99,235,.12); font-weight:900; }
  .hero code { background:rgba(255,255,255,.12); color:white; border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.16); }
  .cta-row { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; margin-top:28px; }
  .btn { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:10px; min-height:46px; padding:13px 18px; border-radius:999px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:900; font-size:14px; transition:transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease; }
  .btn:hover { transform:translateY(-1px); }
  .btn.primary { background:white; color:#1d4ed8; box-shadow:0 18px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.22); }
  .btn.secondary { color:white; background:rgba(255,255,255,.10); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18); }
  .btn.blue { color:white; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),var(--purple)); box-shadow:0 18px 32px rgba(37,99,235,.24); }

  .audit-card { display:flex; flex-direction:column; min-height:100%; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14); border-radius:28px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.09); backdrop-filter:blur(16px); overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 20px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.16); }
  .browser-bar { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:14px 16px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13); background:rgba(15,23,42,.20); }
  .dot { width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:999px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.36); }
  .address { margin-left:6px; flex:1; min-width:0; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); background:rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius:999px; padding:6px 10px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.72); font-size:12px; white-space:nowrap; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; }
  .screenshot-frame { position:relative; height:228px; overflow:hidden; background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,.16), rgba(255,255,255,.04)); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13); }
  .screenshot-frame img { display:block; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:top center; transform:scale(1.01); }
  .screenshot-frame::after { content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(2,6,23,0) 45%, rgba(2,6,23,.50)); pointer-events:none; }
  .screenshot-caption { position:absolute; z-index:1; left:16px; right:16px; bottom:14px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; color:white; font-size:12px; }
  .screenshot-caption span, .screenshot-caption a { padding:6px 10px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22); border-radius:999px; background:rgba(15,23,42,.42); backdrop-filter:blur(8px); text-decoration:none; font-weight:800; }
  .audit-body { padding:22px; }
  .audit-body h3 { margin:16px 0 7px; color:white; font-size:30px; line-height:1.02; letter-spacing:-.05em; }
  .audit-body p { margin:0; color:rgba(226,232,240,.72); font-size:14px; }
  .mini-score { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px; margin-top:18px; }
  .mini-score div { border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13); border-radius:18px; padding:15px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.08); }
  .mini-score span { display:block; color:rgba(226,232,240,.62); font-size:12px; font-weight:850; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.05em; }
  .mini-score strong { display:block; margin-top:4px; color:white; font-size:34px; line-height:1; letter-spacing:-.05em; }
  .hero-footnote { margin-top:18px!important; color:rgba(226,232,240,.62)!important; font-size:13px!important; }

  .report-nav { position:sticky; top:0; z-index:10; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; gap:8px; overflow-x:auto; margin:18px 0 28px; padding:12px; border-radius:999px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.76); border:1px solid var(--line); box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft); backdrop-filter:blur(16px); }
  .report-nav a { white-space:nowrap; text-decoration:none; color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; font-weight:900; padding:9px 13px; border-radius:999px; }
  .report-nav a:hover { color:var(--blue); background:rgba(37,99,235,.08); }
  .report-nav a.active { color:white; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),var(--purple)); box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(37,99,235,.22); }
  /* CTA-style "Purchase report" link — uses a warm amber→orange gradient
     so it reads as a "buy" action and is visually distinct from the cool
     blue→purple "active section" pill. */
  .report-nav a.cta {
    color:white; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#ea580c);
    padding:10px 18px; margin-left:8px;
    box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(234,88,12,.32);
    transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
  }
  .report-nav a.cta:hover {
    color:white; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#ea580c);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow:0 12px 26px rgba(234,88,12,.42);
  }
  .report-nav a.cta::before {
    content:""; display:inline-block; width:5px; height:5px;
    border-radius:50%; background:white; margin-right:7px; vertical-align:middle;
    box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(255,255,255,.28);
  }
  /* Lock the amber styling even when the scrollspy adds .active so the CTA
     never inherits the section-anchor active gradient. */
  .report-nav a.cta.active {
    color:white; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#ea580c);
  }

  .section { margin-top:28px; padding:30px; border-radius:var(--radius); background:var(--panel); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.80); box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft); backdrop-filter:blur(12px); }
  .section-header { display:flex; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:space-between; gap:18px; margin-bottom:18px; }
  h2 { margin:0; color:var(--ink); font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,34px); letter-spacing:-.045em; line-height:1.06; font-weight:950; }
  h3 { color:var(--ink); letter-spacing:-.025em; }
  .section-subtitle { margin:8px 0 0; max-width:720px; color:var(--muted); font-size:14px; }

  .takeaway { position:relative; overflow:hidden; display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto 1fr; gap:20px; align-items:start; padding:28px; border-radius:var(--radius); background:linear-gradient(135deg, #fff7ed 0%, #fff 52%, #eff6ff 100%); border:1px solid rgba(251,146,60,.28); box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft); }
  .takeaway::after { content:""; position:absolute; right:-100px; top:-120px; width:250px; height:250px; border-radius:999px; background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(245,158,11,.24), transparent 70%); }
  .signal-icon { position:relative; z-index:1; width:60px; height:60px; border-radius:20px; display:grid; place-items:center; color:white; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f97316,#dc2626); box-shadow:0 16px 32px rgba(220,38,38,.20); }
  .takeaway-content { position:relative; z-index:1; }
  .takeaway .label { margin-bottom:8px; color:var(--warning); font-size:12px; font-weight:950; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.10em; }
  .takeaway h3 { margin:0 0 10px; font-size:clamp(25px,3.2vw,40px); line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-.05em; }
  .takeaway p { margin:0; max-width:850px; color:var(--muted); }
  .takeaway p + p { margin-top:10px; }
  .takeaway strong { color:var(--ink); }
  .takeaway-note { margin:12px 0 14px!important; max-width:800px; color:#475569!important; font-size:clamp(18px,2vw,24px); line-height:1.35; letter-spacing:-.02em; font-style:italic; }
  .takeaway-note strong { font-style:normal; }

  .cards { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:16px; }
  .card { position:relative; overflow:hidden; min-height:164px; padding:22px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:24px; background:var(--panel-solid); box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(15,23,42,.055); }
  .card::after { content:""; position:absolute; inset:auto -34px -46px auto; width:142px; height:142px; border-radius:999px; background:rgba(37,99,235,.09); }
  .card.risk::after { background:rgba(220,38,38,.11); }
  .card.good::after { background:rgba(22,163,74,.11); }
  .card .label { position:relative; z-index:1; color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; font-weight:950; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.09em; }
  .card .value { position:relative; z-index:1; margin-top:12px; color:var(--ink); font-size:46px; line-height:.95; font-weight:950; letter-spacing:-.06em; }
  .card.risk .value { color:var(--danger); }
  .card.good .value { color:var(--success); }
  .card .caption { position:relative; z-index:1; margin-top:10px; color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; }

  .engine-panel { margin-top:28px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); background:rgba(255,255,255,.82); box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft); overflow:hidden; }
  .engine-head { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto; gap:18px; align-items:center; padding:24px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(239,246,255,.94), rgba(255,255,255,.88)); }
  .engine-head h3 { margin:0 0 6px; font-size:22px; line-height:1.1; }
  .engine-head p { margin:0; max-width:780px; color:var(--muted); font-size:14px; }
  .engine-tabs { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; padding:18px 24px 0; }
  .engine-tab { appearance:none; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:999px; background:#fff; color:var(--muted); cursor:pointer; font:inherit; font-size:13px; font-weight:900; padding:10px 14px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; transition:transform .18s ease,border-color .18s ease,color .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease; }
  .engine-tab:hover { transform:translateY(-1px); border-color:rgba(37,99,235,.32); color:var(--blue); }
  .engine-tab.active { color:white; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),var(--purple)); border-color:transparent; box-shadow:0 14px 28px rgba(37,99,235,.22); }
  .engine-dot { width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:999px; background:currentColor; opacity:.7; }
  .tab-lock { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; border-radius:999px; padding:3px 7px; background:#eef2ff; color:#4f46e5; font-size:10px; font-weight:950; letter-spacing:.04em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .engine-tab.active .tab-lock { background:rgba(255,255,255,.20); color:white; }
  .engine-content { padding:24px; }
  .engine-view { display:none; }
  .engine-view.active { display:block; }
  .engine-detail-grid, .engine-locked-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.95fr) minmax(0,1.05fr); gap:18px; }
  .engine-card { border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:22px; background:white; padding:22px; }
  .engine-card h4 { margin:0 0 12px; color:var(--ink); font-size:17px; letter-spacing:-.02em; }
  .engine-stats { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:12px; }
  .engine-stat { border-radius:16px; background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.18); padding:14px; }
  .engine-stat span { display:block; color:var(--muted); font-size:11px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .engine-stat strong { display:block; margin-top:4px; color:var(--ink); font-size:28px; line-height:1; letter-spacing:-.045em; }
  .query-list { margin-top:14px; display:grid; gap:8px; }
  .query-list div { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.18); border-radius:14px; background:#f8fafc; padding:10px 12px; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink-2); }
  .locked-engine { position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
  .locked-engine::after { content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0), rgba(255,255,255,.72), rgba(255,255,255,0)); transform:translateX(-100%); animation:sheen 3.2s infinite; pointer-events:none; }
  @keyframes sheen { 0%{transform:translateX(-100%)} 42%,100%{transform:translateX(100%)} }
  .placeholder-bars { display:grid; gap:12px; margin-top:18px; }
  .placeholder-bars span { display:block; height:14px; border-radius:999px; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e2e8f0,#f8fafc); }
  .placeholder-bars span:nth-child(2){width:82%}.placeholder-bars span:nth-child(3){width:64%}.placeholder-bars span:nth-child(4){width:74%}
  .unlock-card { border:1px solid rgba(37,99,235,.18); border-radius:22px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(239,246,255,.92), rgba(255,255,255,.94)); padding:24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; }
  .unlock-card h4 { margin:0 0 8px; font-size:20px; color:var(--ink); }
  .unlock-card p { margin:0 0 16px; color:var(--muted); font-size:14px; }
  .unlock-card ul { margin:0; padding-left:18px; color:var(--ink-2); font-size:14px; }
  .unlock-card li + li { margin-top:6px; }

  .insight-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.82fr 1.18fr; gap:18px; }
  .bar-list { display:grid; gap:11px; }
  .bar-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(120px,210px) 1fr 48px; gap:12px; align-items:center; padding:12px 14px; border-radius:18px; background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line); }
  .bar-row .name { color:var(--ink); font-weight:850; font-size:14px; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; }
  .bar-row .bar { height:11px; border-radius:999px; background:#e2e8f0; overflow:hidden; }
  .bar-row .bar > div { height:100%; border-radius:999px; background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue),var(--cyan)); }
  .bar-row .num { color:var(--muted); font-weight:900; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; text-align:right; }
  .empty { color:var(--muted); padding:22px; border:1px dashed rgba(100,116,139,.32); border-radius:18px; background:rgba(248,250,252,.74); font-size:14px; }

  .tech-banner { padding:24px; border-radius:24px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0f9ff,#ede9fe); border:1px solid rgba(37,99,235,.16); display:flex; gap:22px; align-items:center; box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft); }
  .ring { width:100px; height:100px; border-radius:50%; display:grid; place-items:center; position:relative; flex-shrink:0; }
  .ring::before { content:""; position:absolute; inset:10px; border-radius:50%; background:white; }
  .ring strong { position:relative; color:var(--ink); font-size:28px; font-weight:950; letter-spacing:-.045em; }
  .tech-banner h3 { margin:0 0 4px; font-size:22px; }
  .tech-banner p { margin:0; color:var(--muted); font-size:14px; }
  .pillrow { display:flex; gap:6px; margin-top:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .pillrow span { font-size:11px; padding:4px 9px; border-radius:999px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.03em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .pillrow .p { background:#dcfce7; color:var(--success); }.pillrow .w { background:#fef3c7; color:var(--warning); }.pillrow .f { background:#fee2e2; color:var(--danger); }
  .tcheck { margin:12px 0; padding:22px 24px; border-radius:20px; background:white; border:1px solid var(--line); box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft); }
  .tcheck.is-locked { background:linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #fbfdff 100%); }
  .tcheck-head { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .tcheck-head .num { font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; font-weight:950; color:var(--blue); font-size:13px; padding:5px 9px; border-radius:999px; background:rgba(37,99,235,.09); }
  .tcheck-head h4 { margin:0; flex:1; color:var(--ink); font-size:17px; letter-spacing:-.02em; }
  .pill { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; min-height:24px; padding:4px 9px; border-radius:999px; background:#f1f5f9; color:#475569; font-size:11px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.02em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .pill.pass,.pill.good { background:#dcfce7; color:var(--success); }.pill.warn { background:#fef3c7; color:var(--warning); }.pill.fail,.pill.bad { background:#fee2e2; color:var(--danger); }.pill.pill-locked { background:#eef2ff; color:#4f46e5; }
  .tcheck dl { margin:0; display:grid; grid-template-columns:140px 1fr; gap:9px 16px; }
  .tcheck dt { color:var(--muted); font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; font-weight:900; padding-top:3px; }
  .tcheck dd { margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.55; color:var(--ink-2); }
  .score-pass { color:var(--success)!important; font-weight:850; }.score-warn { color:var(--warning)!important; font-weight:850; }.score-fail { color:var(--danger)!important; font-weight:850; }
  .score-row { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .score-blur { flex:1 1 260px; min-width:220px; filter:blur(5px); opacity:.55; user-select:none; pointer-events:none; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; max-width:560px; }
  .unlock-link { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:6px; padding:9px 16px; border-radius:999px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),var(--purple)); color:white; text-decoration:none; font-weight:900; font-size:13px; box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(37,99,235,.28); flex-shrink:0; }
  .fixbox { background:#f8fafc; border-left:4px solid var(--blue); padding:10px 14px; border-radius:8px; font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace; font-size:12px!important; white-space:pre-wrap; }

  .locked-panel { position:relative; min-height:390px; overflow:hidden; margin-top:16px; border-radius:24px; background:white; border:1px solid var(--line); box-shadow:0 14px 32px rgba(15,23,42,.065); }
  .locked-panel .blur { filter:blur(5px); opacity:.52; user-select:none; pointer-events:none; padding:28px; min-height:390px; }
  .locked-panel .overlay { position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:32px 24px; background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.58), rgba(255,255,255,.95) 70%); text-align:center; }
  .overlay-card { width:min(620px,100%); padding:30px 28px; border-radius:24px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.88); border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.26); box-shadow:0 18px 46px rgba(15,23,42,.13); backdrop-filter:blur(12px); }
  .lock-icon { width:46px; height:46px; margin:0 auto 12px; display:grid; place-items:center; border-radius:16px; color:#1d4ed8; background:#eff6ff; }
  .overlay h4 { margin:0 0 8px; color:var(--ink); font-size:22px; letter-spacing:-.035em; }
  .overlay p { margin:0 auto 16px; color:var(--muted); max-width:540px; font-size:14px; }
  table { width:100%; border-collapse:separate; border-spacing:0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:18px; background:white; border:1px solid var(--line); }
  td,th { padding:12px; font-size:13px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.18); text-align:left; }
  th { color:#334155; background:#f8fafc; font-weight:900; text-transform:uppercase; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.06em; }
  tr:last-child td { border-bottom:0; }

  details { margin:12px 0; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:22px; background:white; box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(15,23,42,.055); overflow:hidden; }
  details summary { cursor:pointer; list-style:none; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:18px 20px; color:var(--ink); font-weight:900; }
  details summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }
  details summary::before { content:"+"; display:inline-grid; place-items:center; width:24px; height:24px; border-radius:999px; color:var(--blue); background:rgba(37,99,235,.10); font-weight:950; }
  details[open] summary::before { content:"–"; }
  .response-text { min-height:116px; margin:0 20px 20px; padding:18px; color:var(--muted); background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:16px; font-size:13px; white-space:pre-wrap; }
  .citations { margin: -10px 20px 20px; padding-top: 10px; border-top:1px dashed var(--line); color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; }
  .citations a { color:var(--blue); font-weight:800; text-decoration:none; }

  .cta-block { position:relative; overflow:hidden; margin-top:30px; padding:44px 38px; border-radius:30px; color:white; background:radial-gradient(circle at 86% 0%, rgba(6,182,212,.34), transparent 22rem), linear-gradient(135deg,#1d4ed8 0%,#4338ca 50%,#6d28d9 100%); box-shadow:var(--shadow); text-align:center; }
  .cta-block h2 { color:white; font-size:clamp(31px,4vw,50px); }
  .cta-block > p { margin:12px auto 28px; max-width:690px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.78); }
  .pricing-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:16px; margin:32px 0 8px; text-align:left; }
  .price-card { position:relative; padding:24px 22px 26px; border-radius:22px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.07); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16); backdrop-filter:blur(12px); display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; }
  .price-card.featured { background:linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255,255,255,.16), rgba(255,255,255,.06)); border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.42); box-shadow:0 22px 50px rgba(6,182,212,.25); transform:translateY(-4px); }
  .badge { position:absolute; top:-12px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); padding:5px 12px; border-radius:999px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#f97316); color:white; font-size:10px; font-weight:950; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(249,115,22,.32); }
  .tier-name { font-size:14px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(255,255,255,.72); }
  .tier-price { color:white; font-size:44px; font-weight:950; line-height:1; letter-spacing:-.05em; }
  .tier-price small { font-size:14px; font-weight:800; color:rgba(255,255,255,.62); margin-left:4px; }
  .tier-tagline { margin:0; min-height:42px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.78); font-size:14px; line-height:1.45; }
  .price-card ul { list-style:none; padding:0; margin:4px 0 0; display:grid; gap:8px; }
  .price-card li { display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:flex-start; color:rgba(255,255,255,.86); font-size:13px; line-height:1.4; }
  .price-card li::before { content:"✓"; color:#34d399; font-weight:950; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:1px; }
  .tier-cta-form { margin:auto 0 0; display:flex; }
  .tier-cta-form .tier-cta { width:100%; }
  .tier-cta-form.save-form { flex-direction:column; gap:8px; }
  .save-form .save-email { padding:11px 14px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35); background:rgba(255,255,255,.10); color:white; font:inherit; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; }
  .save-form .save-email::placeholder { color:rgba(255,255,255,.55); }
  .save-form .save-email:focus { outline:none; border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.65); background:rgba(255,255,255,.16); }
  .save-form .save-cta-btn { background:white; color:#1d4ed8; }
  .tier-cta { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-top:auto; padding:12px 18px; border-radius:999px; background:white; color:#1d4ed8; text-decoration:none; font-weight:900; font-size:14px; border:0; cursor:pointer; font-family:inherit; }
  .price-card.featured .tier-cta { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#f97316); color:white; box-shadow:0 14px 28px rgba(249,115,22,.35); }
  .price-card.outline .tier-cta { background:transparent; color:white; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4); }
  .price-card.current { background:rgba(255,255,255,.06); border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.16); }
  .current-badge { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#10b981,#059669)!important; }
  .tier-row-heading { margin:20px 0 12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.78); font-size:13px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.10em; text-transform:uppercase; text-align:left; }
  .pricing-grid-2 { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); max-width:760px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto; }
  .footer-note { margin:26px 0 0; text-align:center; color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; }

  /* Belt-and-braces: stop any inner element from causing horizontal scroll
     on phones (was happening with wide tables + the sticky nav on Safari). */
  html, body { overflow-x: clip; max-width: 100%; }
  img, table, pre { max-width: 100%; }

  /* Tablet: hero collapses + 4-card grid becomes 2-col + 2-card pricing
     becomes 2-col (the in-report grid is .pricing-grid-2 for monthly). */
  @media (max-width:930px) {
    .hero-grid,.insight-grid,.engine-detail-grid,.engine-locked-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .cards { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
    .pricing-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }
    .pricing-grid-2 { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }
    .price-card.featured { transform:none; }
    .hero,.section { padding:26px; }
  }
  /* Phone: everything stacks single-column, nav becomes a horizontal
     swipe-strip with snap points, tables get a scroll-wrapper, headline
     sizes down so it doesn't break to its own line absurdly. */
  @media (max-width:620px) {
    .shell { width:calc(100% - 24px); padding-top:16px; padding-left:0; padding-right:0; }
    .topbar,.section-header,.tech-banner { align-items:flex-start; flex-direction:column; }
    .cards,.mini-score,.engine-stats { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .bar-row { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:8px; }
    .bar-row .num { text-align:left; }
    .takeaway { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .hero,.section,.cta-block { padding:22px 18px; border-radius:22px; }
    h1 { font-size:34px; line-height:1.05; }
    h2 { font-size:24px; }
    .hero-lede { font-size:15px; }
    .meta { gap:6px; }
    .meta .chip { font-size:11px; padding:5px 9px; }
    .report-nav {
      border-radius:18px; padding:8px; gap:6px;
      flex-wrap:nowrap; justify-content:flex-start;
      scroll-snap-type:x mandatory; -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;
    }
    .report-nav a { scroll-snap-align:start; font-size:12px; padding:8px 11px; }
    .report-nav a.cta { padding:9px 14px; margin-left:4px; }
    .tcheck dl { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:4px; }
    .tcheck { overflow-x:auto; }
    .pricing-grid,.pricing-grid-2 { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:14px; margin-top:20px; }
    .price-card { padding:22px 20px; }
    .tier-cta-form.save-form { flex-direction:column; }
    .save-form .save-email, .save-form .save-cta-btn { width:100%; }
    table { display:block; overflow-x:auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch; }
    .footer-note { font-size:11px; }
  }
  @media print { body { background:white; } .shell { width:100%; padding:0; } .report-nav,.cta-row,.btn { display:none; } .section,.hero,.cta-block { box-shadow:none; break-inside:avoid; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
{% set visible = (agg.visible_pct | float) %}
{% set total_queries = agg.total %}
{% set visible_count = ((visible / 100) * total_queries) | round | int %}
{% set competitors_in_text = (agg.competitor_text_counts | map(attribute=0) | list) if agg.competitor_text_counts else [] %}
{% set competitors_in_citations = (agg.competitor_citation_counts | map(attribute=0) | list) if agg.competitor_citation_counts else [] %}
{% set competitors_seen = (competitors_in_text + competitors_in_citations) | unique | list %}
{% set first_query = agg.by_query.keys() | list | first %}
{% set first_rows = agg.by_query[first_query] if first_query else [] %}
{% set competitor_names_strong %}{% for c in competitors_seen %}<strong>{{ c }}</strong>{% if not loop.last %}{% if loop.revindex0 == 1 %} and {% else %}, {% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endset %}
<main class="shell">
  <header class="topbar">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="monitoraeo home"><img class="wordmark" src="/static/monitoraeo-wordmark.png" alt="monitoraeo"></a>
    <div class="top-actions"><span class="chip warning">Free preview</span><span class="chip dark">{{ config.brand.name }}</span></div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">AI answer visibility audit</span>
        <h1>{% if visible == 0 %}{{ config.brand.name }} is invisible in Google AI Overviews.{% elif visible < 50 %}{{ config.brand.name }} is barely showing up in Google AI Overviews.{% else %}{{ config.brand.name }} appears in Google AI Overviews — but who else is being cited?{% endif %}</h1>
        <p class="hero-lede"><strong>Future customers now use AI to help answer their questions.</strong> Find out who is being recommended and how your business performs. This preview shows whether Google AI Overviews names {{ config.brand.name }}, cites the site, or sends attention to competitors instead.</p>
        <p class="hero-lede">{% if visible == 0 %}<strong>Google's AI did not mention {{ config.brand.name }} once</strong> across {{ total_queries }} commercial questions in this category.{% else %}Google's AI named <strong>{{ config.brand.name }} in {{ visible_count }} of {{ total_queries }} answers</strong> in this preview.{% endif %} The full audit expands this to the major AI engines and turns the findings into a practical action plan.</p>
        <div class="hero-meta"><span class="chip blue">Domain <code>{{ config.brand.domain }}</code></span><span class="chip blue">Google AI Overviews</span><span class="chip blue">{{ total_queries }} queries tested</span></div>
        <div class="cta-row"><a href="#visibility" class="btn primary">View snapshot</a><a href="#upgrade" class="btn secondary">Unlock full audit</a></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="audit-card" aria-label="Audit summary card">
        <div class="browser-bar"><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><div class="address">https://{{ config.brand.domain }}</div></div>
        <div class="screenshot-frame">
          {% if screenshot %}<img src="{{ screenshot }}" alt="Screenshot of {{ config.brand.domain }}">{% else %}<img src="https://s.wordpress.com/mshots/v1/https%3A%2F%2F{{ config.brand.domain }}?w=1200" alt="Screenshot of {{ config.brand.domain }}">{% endif %}
          <div class="screenshot-caption"><span>Website audited</span><a href="https://{{ config.brand.domain }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ config.brand.domain }} ↗</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="audit-body">
          <span class="chip warning">Audit subject</span>
          <h3>{{ config.brand.name }} visibility check</h3>
          <p>Snapshot of how Google AI Overview surfaces, cites and compares the brand in buyer-facing queries.</p>
          <div class="mini-score"><div><span>Visibility</span><strong>{{ agg.visible_pct }}%</strong></div><div><span>Citation rate</span><strong>{{ agg.cited_pct }}%</strong></div></div>
          <p class="hero-footnote">Full report expands to 5 engines, 40 queries and 200 AI answers.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <nav class="report-nav" aria-label="Report sections"><a href="#visibility">Snapshot</a><a href="#engines">Engines</a><a href="#sources">Sources</a>{% if tech %}<a href="#foundations">Foundations</a>{% endif %}<a href="#unlock">Unlocks</a><a href="#evidence">Evidence</a><a href="#upgrade" class="cta">Purchase report</a></nav>

  <section class="section" id="visibility">
    <div class="takeaway">
      <div class="signal-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 9v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M12 17h.01" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
      <div class="takeaway-content">
        <div class="label">The takeaway</div>
        <h3>{% if visible == 0 %}{{ total_queries }} potential customers asked Google a question {{ config.brand.name }} should answer — and got an answer that did not include {{ config.brand.name }}.{% elif visible < 50 %}{{ config.brand.name }} only appears in {{ visible_count }} of {{ total_queries }} Google AI answers — there is a clear visibility gap.{% else %}{{ config.brand.name }} shows up in Google AI answers — now check whether the other engines agree.{% endif %}</h3>
        {% if competitors_seen %}<p class="takeaway-note"><em>Google pointed them to {{ competitor_names_strong | safe }} instead.</em></p>{% endif %}
        <p><strong>{{ agg.visible_pct }}% visibility</strong> means {% if visible == 0 %}{{ config.brand.name }} was not named in this sample{% else %}{{ visible_count }} of {{ total_queries }} answers named {{ config.brand.name }} directly{% endif %}.</p>
        <p>The full report unlocks 4 more AI engines, 32 more queries, hallucination detection, competitor analysis and prioritised fixes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header" style="margin-top:28px;"><div><h2>Your Google AI Overview snapshot</h2><p class="section-subtitle">A fast read on whether Google names {{ config.brand.name }}, links to {{ config.brand.domain }}, or relies on competing sources.</p></div><span class="chip dark">Free tier</span></div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card {% if visible < 30 %}risk{% elif visible >= 60 %}good{% endif %}"><div class="label">Visibility</div><div class="value">{{ agg.visible_pct }}%</div><div class="caption">of answers named {{ config.brand.name }}</div></div>
      <div class="card {% if agg.cited_pct < 20 %}risk{% elif agg.cited_pct >= 50 %}good{% endif %}"><div class="label">Citation rate</div><div class="value">{{ agg.cited_pct }}%</div><div class="caption">of answers linked to {{ config.brand.name }}</div></div>
      <div class="card {% if agg.avg_competitors_cited > 1 %}risk{% endif %}"><div class="label">Competitors cited</div><div class="value">{{ agg.avg_competitors_cited }}</div><div class="caption">average per question</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="label">Questions tested</div><div class="value">{{ total_queries }}</div><div class="caption">free preview sample</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="engines">
    <div class="engine-panel">
      <div class="engine-head"><div><h3>Choose an AI engine to inspect visibility</h3><p>Google is available in the free preview. The paid audit compares ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity and Gemini using the same scoring model.</p></div><span class="chip blue">5-engine coverage</span></div>
      <div class="engine-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="AI engine visibility selector">
        <button class="engine-tab active" type="button" data-engine-tab="google"><span class="engine-dot"></span>Google AI</button>
        <button class="engine-tab" type="button" data-engine-tab="chatgpt"><span class="engine-dot"></span>ChatGPT <span class="tab-lock">Unlock</span></button>
        <button class="engine-tab" type="button" data-engine-tab="claude"><span class="engine-dot"></span>Claude <span class="tab-lock">Unlock</span></button>
        <button class="engine-tab" type="button" data-engine-tab="perplexity"><span class="engine-dot"></span>Perplexity <span class="tab-lock">Unlock</span></button>
        <button class="engine-tab" type="button" data-engine-tab="gemini"><span class="engine-dot"></span>Gemini <span class="tab-lock">Unlock</span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="engine-content">
        <div class="engine-view active" data-engine-view="google"><div class="engine-detail-grid"><div class="engine-card"><span class="chip warning">Available now</span><h4 style="margin-top:16px;">Google AI Overview visibility</h4><div class="engine-stats"><div class="engine-stat"><span>Visibility</span><strong>{{ agg.visible_pct }}%</strong></div><div class="engine-stat"><span>Citation rate</span><strong>{{ agg.cited_pct }}%</strong></div><div class="engine-stat"><span>Queries</span><strong>{{ total_queries }}</strong></div><div class="engine-stat"><span>Competitors</span><strong>{{ agg.avg_competitors_cited }}</strong></div></div></div><div class="engine-card"><h4>What this means</h4><p>{% if visible == 0 %}Google AI Overviews did not name {{ config.brand.name }} in any tested answer.{% else %}Google AI Overviews named {{ config.brand.name }} in {{ visible_count }} of {{ total_queries }} tested answers.{% endif %}</p><p>The full audit shows whether that is a Google-specific issue or an AI-wide discovery gap.</p><div class="query-list"><div><span>Brand questions</span><strong>tested</strong></div><div><span>Category questions</span><strong>tested</strong></div><div><span>Problem-led questions</span><strong>tested</strong></div><div><span>Comparison questions</span><strong>full audit</strong></div></div></div></div></div>
        {% for engine in ['chatgpt','claude','perplexity','gemini'] %}<div class="engine-view" data-engine-view="{{ engine }}"><div class="engine-locked-grid locked-engine"><div class="engine-card"><span class="chip dark">Locked</span><h4 style="margin-top:16px;">{{ engine | title }} visibility data</h4><div class="placeholder-bars"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div><div class="unlock-card"><h4>See whether {{ engine | title }} recommends {{ config.brand.name }}</h4><p>The full audit captures answers, citations, sentiment, competitors and hallucination flags for this engine.</p><ul><li>Brand inclusion by query type</li><li>Competitors named in the same response</li><li>Evidence and content opportunities</li></ul></div></div></div>{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="sources">
    <div class="section-header"><div><h2>Competitor and source intelligence</h2><p class="section-subtitle">The preview shows early source patterns. The full audit reveals the recurring competitors, domains and page types shaping AI answers.</p></div></div>
    <div class="insight-grid"><div><h3 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;">Competitors Google cited or named</h3>{% if agg.competitor_citation_counts or agg.competitor_text_counts %}{% set comp_data = agg.competitor_citation_counts if agg.competitor_citation_counts else agg.competitor_text_counts %}{% set max_cmp = comp_data[0][1] %}<div class="bar-list">{% for name,count in comp_data %}<div class="bar-row"><div class="name">{{ name }}</div><div class="bar"><div style="width:{{ (count / max_cmp * 100) | round(0) }}%;"></div></div><div class="num">{{ count }}×</div></div>{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<div class="empty">No competitors were detected in this {{ total_queries }}-query sample.</div>{% endif %}</div><div><h3 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;">Where Google's AI gets its answers</h3>{% if agg.top_domains %}{% set max_count = agg.top_domains[0][1] %}<div class="bar-list">{% for domain,count in agg.top_domains[:8] %}<div class="bar-row"><div class="name">{{ domain }}</div><div class="bar"><div style="width:{{ (count / max_count * 100) | round(0) }}%;"></div></div><div class="num">{{ count }}×</div></div>{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<div class="empty">No external citations captured in this sample.</div>{% endif %}</div></div>
  </section>

  {% if tech %}
  <section class="section" id="foundations">
    <div class="section-header"><div><h2>Technical AEO/GEO foundations</h2><p class="section-subtitle">The first 3 checks are visible in the preview. The remaining checks are blurred and unlock in the full audit.</p></div><span class="chip dark">{{ tech.checks | length }} checks</span></div>
    <div class="tech-banner"><div class="ring" style="background:conic-gradient({% if tech.overall_score >= 70 %}var(--success){% elif tech.overall_score >= 40 %}var(--warning){% else %}var(--danger){% endif %} {{ tech.overall_score * 3.6 }}deg, #eef0f3 0deg);"><strong>{{ tech.overall_score }}</strong></div><div><h3>{% if tech.overall_score >= 70 %}Strong AEO foundations{% elif tech.overall_score >= 40 %}Mixed — fixable{% else %}Weak foundations — start here{% endif %}</h3><p>Overall readiness score across {{ tech.checks | length }} technical checks on <code>{{ tech.domain }}</code>.</p><div class="pillrow"><span class="p">{{ tech.pass_count }} pass</span><span class="w">{{ tech.warn_count }} warn</span><span class="f">{{ tech.fail_count }} fail</span></div></div></div>
    {% for c in tech.checks %}{% set is_locked = (c.tier > 1) %}<div class="tcheck {% if is_locked %}is-locked{% endif %}"><div class="tcheck-head"><span class="num">{{ '%02d' | format(loop.index) }}</span><h4>{{ c.title }}</h4>{% if is_locked %}<span class="pill pill-locked">Locked in preview</span>{% else %}<span class="pill {{ c.status }}">{{ c.status }}</span>{% endif %}</div><dl><dt>Check</dt><dd>{{ c.title }}</dd><dt>Expected</dt><dd>{{ c.expected }}</dd><dt>Why it matters</dt><dd>{{ c.why }}</dd><dt>How you scored</dt>{% if is_locked %}<dd class="score-row"><span class="score-blur">{{ c.score_label }} — {{ c.detail or 'Detailed finding hidden in preview.' }}</span><a href="#upgrade" class="unlock-link">Unlock score →</a></dd>{% else %}<dd class="score-{{ c.status }}">{{ c.score_label }}{% if c.detail %} <span style="color:var(--muted);font-weight:normal;">— {{ c.detail }}</span>{% endif %}</dd>{% if c.fix %}<dt>How to fix</dt><dd class="fixbox">{{ c.fix }}</dd>{% endif %}{% endif %}</dl></div>{% endfor %}
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <section class="section" id="unlock">
    <div class="section-header"><div><h2>What unlocks in the full audit</h2><p class="section-subtitle">The paid report turns the free snapshot into a full evidence base and action plan.</p></div></div>
    <h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:18px;">Engine heatmap — how 5 engines compare</h3>
